{"parse":{"title":"2019 Cannes Film Festival","pageid":57864049,"revid":1375929673,"text":{"*":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"In_Competition\">In Competition</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2019_Cannes_Film_Festival&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: In Competition\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2019_Cannes_Film_Festival&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: In Competition\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>The following films were selected to compete for the <i><span title=\"French-language text\"><span lang=\"fr\" style=\"font-style: normal;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Palme_d%27Or\" title=\"Palme d&#39;Or\">Palme d'Or</a></span></span></i>:<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Films2019&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Films2019-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%; margin-bottom:4px\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">English title\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Original title\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Director(s)\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Production country\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><a href=\"/wiki/Atlantics\" title=\"Atlantics\">Atlantics</a></i> <small> (CdO) </small>\n</td>\n<td><span title=\"French-language text\"><i lang=\"fr\">Atlantique</i></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mati_Diop\" title=\"Mati Diop\">Mati Diop</a>\n</td>\n<td>Senegal, France, Belgium\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><i><a href=\"/w